# Technical Manual
## Install
See System Repo `REQUIREMENTS.md` and `DEPLOYMENT.md`.

## Configuration
- Local: automatic for `localhost`.
- Hosting: create `hosting-config.php` from the example (host, name, user, pass). Never commit it.
- Docker: copy `.env.example` to `.env`.

## Maintenance
| Task | How |
|---|---|
| Backup | phpMyAdmin → Export (SQL), regularly and before updates |
| Restore | Import SQL into an empty database |
| Add admin | Insert into `users` with a bcrypt hash from `password_hash()`, role `admin`; change password after login |
| Change loan rules | Account & Requests → Settings |
| Clear login locks | `DELETE FROM student_login_locks WHERE student_id=?;` and `DELETE FROM login_attempts;` |
| Missing chat tables | Import `migration_chat.sql` |
| Update system | Upload changed files only; keep `hosting-config.php` |

## Troubleshooting
| Message / symptom | Cause / fix |
|---|---|
| "Create hosting-config.php…" | File missing on a non-local host |
| "Enter your current … MySQL password" | `pass` empty or still the placeholder |
| "Could not connect to the database" | Wrong host/name/user/pass; verify in hosting panel |
| Blank page | Check server error log (DEBUG is on only for localhost) |
| Photos not saving | `uploads/students/` not writable |

## Security checklist
HTTPS on · default passwords changed · `hosting-config.php` private · regular backups · PHP execution blocked in `uploads/`.
